@startuml ChangeRequestWorkflow
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #Cyan/SkyBlue
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #DarkSlateGray
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #LemonChiffon
skinparam NoteBorderColor #DarkGoldenRod

title Cross-Repository Change Request & Release Workflow

|Consuming Agent (CR Author)|
start
:1. Create Change Request;
note right
  Filename: CR<NNN>_<Requester>_to_<Provider>_<Topic>.md
  (Filename is IMMUTABLE - Provider MUST NOT rename)
end note
:Publish CR in repository;

|Provider Agent|
:2. Receive CR & Investigate Root Cause;
:Implement Fix & Run Provider Test Suite;
:Publish Package Release & Release Notes;
note left
  Filename: <Component>_RELEASE_NOTES_<Version>.md
  (MUST reference exact CR document filename)
end note

|Consuming Agent (CR Author)|
:3. Review Release Notes & Evaluate Solution;
:Run Independent Consumer Verification Tests
(Receiver-Led Definition of Done);

if (Solution satisfies consumer requirements?) then (Yes - Accepted)
  :Create Acceptance Evaluation Document;
  :Update package references & close CR loop;
  stop
else (No - Rejected)
  :Create Rejection Evaluation Document;
  :Create Follow-up Sub-CR;
  detach
endif

@enduml
